>(<span class=\"mw-formatted-date\" title=\"1913-09-26\">1913-09-26</span>). \"Founder of the F.A.\". <i>Birmingham Gazette</i>: 6.</cite>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Unknown author<span style=\"display: none;\">Unknown author</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"23877204":{"pageid":23877204,"ns":6,"title":"File:Original laws of the game 1863.jpg","index":7,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":237715,"width":1600,"height":1200,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Original_laws_of_the_game_1863.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Original_laws_of_the_game_1863.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=23877204","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2013-01-15 14:32:57","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Original laws of the game 1863","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"GFDL|Taken with Canon Digital IXUS 90 IS|Ebenezer Cobb Morley|Association football laws|The Football Association|1863 in association football|License migration redundant|Self-published work|1863 works in the United Kingdom|English-language manuscripts in England|Collection of the National Football Museum","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Photo of the original hand written 'Laws of the game' for association Football drafted for and behalf of The Football Association by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ebenezer_Cobb_Morley\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Ebenezer Cobb Morley\">Ebenezer Cobb Morley</a> in 1863 on display at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Football_Museum\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:National Football Museum\">National Football Museum</a>, Manchester.<br> The handwriting on the left is that of Cobb Morley and reads:<br>\n<p><i>Meeting 24th November 1863</i><br>\n<i>Freemasons Tavern</i><br><br>\n</p><p><i>The minutes of the meeting held 17th Nov were read and confirmed.</i><br>\n<i>Letters from<br></i>\n<i>Mr Steward<br>The Captain of Football at Shrewsbury School<br></i>\n<i>The Rev J C Thring<br></i>\nLt H C Moore<i><br></i>\n<i>Mr Chambers</i><br>\n<i>and Mr J Bell </i>\nwere read<i><br></i>\n</p>\n<i>The Secretary laid before the meeting the (illegible, but probably \u2018rules\u2019) which had been drawn up in (illegible, but probably \u2018pursuance\u2019) of the (illegible) at previous meetings which were as follows</i>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2012-09-18","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Adrian_Roebuck&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Adrian Roebuck (page does not exist)\">Adrian Roebuck</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Attribution":{"value":"Adrian Roebuck","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-3.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"129535076":{"pageid":129535076,"ns":6,"title":"File:Plaque to Ebenezer Cobb Morley - geograph.org.uk - 4513290.jpg","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":306587,"width":2000,"height":1544,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Plaque_to_Ebenezer_Cobb_Morley_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4513290.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Plaque_to_Ebenezer_Cobb_Morley_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4513290.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=129535076","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2023-03-12 17:57:14","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Plaque to Ebenezer Cobb Morley - geograph.org.uk - 4513290","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Images from Geograph Britain and Ireland|The Lord Mayor's Centenary Plaques, Kingston upon Hull","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"GPSLatitude":{"value":"53.747701","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSLongitude":{"value":"-0.335986","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Plaque to Ebenezer Cobb Morley\u00a0<span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noprint\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Plaque_to_Ebenezer_Cobb_Morley_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4513290.jpg#ooui-php-4\" title=\"Edit this at Structured Data on Commons\"><img alt=\"Edit this at Structured Data on Commons\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/comm